*kill* | V-$CHIPVR ($CHIPCN)

''kill(pid, signal)''

Sends a signal to a process.

*Parameters:*
- ''pid'': Number process ID to signal
- ''signal'': Number signal to send (see ''libsignals.chh'')

*Returns:*
- ''ok'' on success
- ''err'' on failure

*Errors:*
- Runtime error if pid is not a number
- Runtime error if signal is not a number
